`CANDIDATE STORY/BOARD SUBROUTINE / EXISTING NOTION METHOD FIRST / NOT INSTALLED CURRENT / NOT NEW FRAMEWORK / BROADER VALIDATION + INDEPENDENT REVIEW REQUIRED / NO_PROMOTION`.

`FIELD OBSERVED=0 / FIELD MEASURED=0 / G1F HOLD / NO_PROMOTION / NTS` remain unchanged.

